{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1000_p", "source_sha256": "8c13a75e8c76904b7756f770b820ea93e6fe0bff47b5dc234645555e94ed749a", "ja": "（今日は麗花がプロデュースした服のPRも兼ねた\n雑誌撮影だった。とてもいい仕上がりになりそうだ！）", "zh": "（今天是为丽花设计的服装进行宣传的杂志拍摄。看来会有非常棒的成片！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1001_048rei", "source_sha256": "dddf9dc0e3b5aa3f54e87165773fa577ffece395f432db35b62d35a40f26ac8a", "ja": "撮影とっても楽しかったです♪　もしかして……\nお疲れデューサーさんだったりしますか？", "zh": "拍摄特别开心♪　难道说……\n你是累坏了的制作人先生吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1002_p", "source_sha256": "4ac36e2b68621dc4025836bf608ec9015fdd0d1360638af3b543490c00a68a75", "ja": "え？　そんなことはないけど……\n疲れてるように見えるか？", "zh": "诶？没有那回事，不过……\n我看起来像是很累吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f4572bfd5e7de273ee66a975d12f73e6e45d14660b2054445e7663654ff1ea3", "ja": "いいえ、ただの確認です！　それじゃあ\n{$P$}さん、行きましょう！", "zh": "没有，只是确认一下而已！那么\n{$P$}先生，我们走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1004_p", "source_sha256": "bfa1acb444a4eb6f97d74fbe2e8713d1181765f65347209c59a1cc5746f53bc3", "ja": "そうだな。撮影も終わったし、帰る準備を……。", "zh": "是啊。拍摄也结束了，准备回去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1005_048rei", "source_sha256": "5d8a3bfbd485e07809cc0d960ecafc3748c8a399659fad5242262eaaacd0bd88", "ja": "何をいってるんですか？\nアウトドアの続きをやりましょう！　ゴーゴー♪", "zh": "你在说什么呀？\n继续我们的户外活动吧！冲冲冲♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1a66725f19ca67f6797187f28743df251ca74c228493dcc90b8ef7b06643103a", "ja": "ええっ！？\nどこに行くんだ、麗花！　待ってくれ～！", "zh": "诶诶！？\n丽花，你要去哪儿？等等我——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "393e4ff0639ad1786e58d3440b75e8a1f66cec78e3659a9c2fe35df5a5e8016c", "ja": "わあ……桜、すっごくキレイですね。", "zh": "哇……樱花，真的好漂亮啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1008_p", "source_sha256": "ccbca0118aa7898a007e90356f2e10c7bafc4c129b780e06f5925d63fdc9526f", "ja": "（麗花を追いかけると、キャンプ場のそばの並木道に\n辿り着いた。こんな場所があるとは知らなかった……）", "zh": "（追着丽花跑，来到了露营地旁的林荫道。没想到这里还有这样的地方……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1009_048rei", "source_sha256": "86ac4f73fbf24a51843e12d1e99e3baa2d5e1ff97a314dc523aafb1223ad48c0", "ja": "というわけで、この服を着ている\n今しかできないことをしてみたかったんです♪", "zh": "所以呢，我想试试做些只有现在穿着这身衣服才能做的事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1010_p", "source_sha256": "7fe03ed48e34ac1dde5f8300da8f7a92cc7b8b71c7ebcad5402fea3b48cb85fd", "ja": "ん？　脈絡はよくわからないが……\n確かに、ちょうど見頃で花見にぴったりの時期だな。", "zh": "嗯？虽然不太明白其中的联系……不过，确实正是花开得最好的时候，很适合赏花。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "e23cc2e68d26683cc150c30107e65726e85545a2b4ce0ee7a8a1a5bccc15824b", "ja": "{$P$}さん、聞いてください。\n私、この衣装を考えた時に、大発見したんです。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你听我说。\n我在构思这套服装的时候，有了重大发现。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "12c46fe1814f6b5c02d813570933e007ad66a063f89a610db493ca1e12da8607", "ja": "サンマに大根おろしを乗せたり、スイカに塩をかけたり\n……目玉焼きには、なんか色々かけたりしますよね？", "zh": "秋刀鱼上放萝卜泥，西瓜上撒盐……煎鸡蛋也会加各种各样的调料，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1013_p", "source_sha256": "23142bc416a48a9e6efd0f577bd50c97767d2ee12896947c9326ca090a502d88", "ja": "えっ、うん、そうだな……？", "zh": "诶，嗯，是这样没错……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1014_048rei", "source_sha256": "d8f06ce2532525c0efa0ad109914008596986f21fd6adabf1f262ca4dc18b0fe", "ja": "そのままでも料理は美味しいですけど、ちょっとだけ\n足すと、とっても美味しくなるって……大発見です！", "zh": "料理原本就很好吃，不过只要稍微加一点，就会变得特别好吃……这是个重大发现！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1015_p", "source_sha256": "e3436d06da7d9eb8910c84ff8b930c0a25ba6738be90c3f35b11a93861c946b0", "ja": "大発見……そ、そうか……。", "zh": "大发现……这、这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1016_048rei", "source_sha256": "0dfdef3bb7586bbcbc522b22a03abfcbee3c7641b26e45f4490e2875af9205d3", "ja": "はい。だから、桜には{$P$}さん\nだって！　撮影の時に閃いたんです♪", "zh": "是的。所以，樱花就该是{$P$}先生！这是我拍摄时突然想到的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1017_p", "source_sha256": "64ed59bafacc98844c376db7780efa0a6d3fc034706c18f33b26b188d28c4757", "ja": "桜に？　ええと……\n要は、一緒に花見をしたかったってことか？", "zh": "樱花？呃……也就是说，你是想一起赏花，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1018_048rei", "source_sha256": "91651f8d83a92aa28d9cb0921ef3bbc070de019378b93fa1743e1756b5f00c9c", "ja": "えへへ♪　そんな感じです。", "zh": "嘿嘿♪差不多就是这个意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1019_048rei", "source_sha256": "4b6ec27b6f8ea6afe1bbb0fd2bdb1855e433df0bb38d6d9f6899a635d8ab1d36", "ja": "きっとこの先も、桜を見る機会はあると思います。\nでも、今日のこの景色は今しか見られません……。", "zh": "我想以后一定还会有机会赏樱。\n不过，今天这样的景色，只有现在才能看到……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1020_048rei", "source_sha256": "e096d1f867bb68b00241538970a56512172e7b000186e7db0693c2c2dbc47d25", "ja": "一人で楽しむのもいいですけど、\n二人で見た方が、ずっとずっと楽しいですから。", "zh": "一个人欣赏也不错，\n但两个人一起看，会开心得多得多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1021_p", "source_sha256": "8e1abfc1ce0c92b46b0e19c7026971991212dd7111e18043b53c21c5b4080598", "ja": "麗花……。", "zh": "丽花……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1022_048rei", "source_sha256": "2d71f636d0b5632057068699e1744735666277b8e7ad3781fd956deecddc7215", "ja": "夏も秋も冬も……。{$P$}さんの\nちょい足しは、一年中よりどりみどりですね♪", "zh": "夏天也是、秋天也是、冬天也是……\n无论一年当中的哪个季节，都有很多能给{$P$}先生添点的新花样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1023_p", "source_sha256": "ee5237d65626ec009f30a11173989d50fbd399d80191458ca1666ce3a8c62b7e", "ja": "そっちがちょい足しなのか……！？", "zh": "原来是你来锦上添花吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_048rei0634_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_048rei0634_1024_048rei", "source_sha256": "8d07bb5ce0f9355b807fef275e81cefe3b8121b75ea76359a742c51679eefc9f", "ja": "ふふ、当たり前じゃないですか！　いろんな景色を\n一緒に見ましょうね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "呵呵，这不是理所当然的吗！我们一起去看看各种各样的风景吧，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
